  "__comment": "Vanilla plants -> TFC plants (tfc:plant/<x>), each a name/closest-match fixed default plus a candidate pool (keyed on the converted result) so the player can re-pick via the Replace GUI. Covers: small flowers (pool mctfc:subst/plant/flower) and their potted forms (tfc:plant/potted/<x>, pool potted_flower); double-tall flowers sunflower/lilac/rose_bush/peony (pool tall_flower); vines (minecraft:vine -> jungle_vines, pool vine incl. ivy); short grass/fern (single, pools short_grass/fern); and tall_grass/large_fern (double, pools tall_grass/large_fern). Double-tall plants use copy_properties {half:part} (vanilla uses 'half', TFC uses 'part'; both serialize lower/upper) and are placed atomically by TwoTallPlantPlacementHandler. Edit/reload with /reload.",
